<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>For You 🌹</title>
<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    height:100vh;
    background:#fff0f3;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Arial';
}

.bouquet{
    font-size:3em;
    animation: float 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
    0%{transform:translateY(0);}
    50%{transform:translateY(-15px);}
    100%{transform:translateY(0);}
}

h1{
    color:#ff4d6d;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bouquet">🌷🌹🌸💐🌺</div>
<h1>Wishing You a Magical New Year ✨</h1>
<p>May all your dreams come true 💖</p>

</body>
</html>
